---
// AgitationSection.astro - Clean Financial Reality & Cost of Inaction Breakdown
---

<section class="section section-subtle agitation-section" id="agitation">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header-clean">
      <h2>
        Here's What Staying on Flat-Rate Pricing Actually Costs You
      </h2>
      <p>
        A flat 2.9%–3.5% + $0.30 fee looks simple on an invoice, but it represents an invisible, ongoing tax on your gross margin.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Clean Financial Impact Points -->
    <div class="impact-metrics-row">
      <div class="impact-col">
        <div class="impact-tag tag-rose">ANNUAL FEE LOSS</div>
        <div class="impact-figure text-rose">$8K – $22K</div>
        <h3 class="impact-heading">Overpaid in Flat-Rate Markups</h3>
        <p class="impact-copy">
          Merchants processing $30K–$100K/month overpay thousands annually because aggregators pocket the difference between wholesale interchange (often ~1.4%) and flat retail fees.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="impact-col">
        <div class="impact-tag tag-rose">ACCOUNT RISK</div>
        <div class="impact-figure text-rose">1 in 4</div>
        <h3 class="impact-heading">Scaling Accounts Capped or Frozen</h3>
        <p class="impact-copy">
          Standard aggregators use automated AI risk bots. Sudden sales spikes or single chargeback clusters often lead to instant volume caps with zero human consultation.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="impact-col">
        <div class="impact-tag tag-rose">CASH FLOW DRAG</div>
        <div class="impact-figure text-rose">14 Days</div>
        <h3 class="impact-heading">Delayed Access to Working Capital</h3>
        <p class="impact-copy">
          Multi-day settlement lags prevent you from reinvesting same-day earnings into ad campaigns, bulk inventory discounts, and immediate business expansion.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pricing Comparison Infographic Visual -->
    <div class="comparison-clean-wrap">
      <div class="comparison-title-wrap text-center">
        <h3>Flat-Rate vs. OneFunding Interchange-Plus Comparison</h3>
        <p>Direct mathematical breakdown on transaction cost savings</p>
      </div>
      <div class="comparison-image-frame">
        <img 
          src="/images/pricing_comparison.jpg" 
          alt="FinTech comparison between Flat-Rate Pricing and Interchange-Plus Transparent Pricing" 
          class="comparison-image"
          loading="lazy"
          width="960"
          height="540"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Action Transition Box -->
    <div class="agitation-action-box text-center">
      <p class="agitation-action-text">
        Every day you stay on flat-rate pricing is cash flowing out of your business into aggregator profits.
      </p>
      <a href="#auditForm" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
        <span>Check My Rate Savings →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .impact-metrics-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .impact-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .impact-tag {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .tag-rose {
    background: var(--rose-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--rose-border);
    color: var(--rose-primary);
  }

  .impact-figure {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2.35rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .text-rose {
    color: var(--rose-primary);
  }

  .impact-heading {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-heading);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .impact-copy {
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    color: var(--text-body);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Comparison Wrap */
  .comparison-clean-wrap {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 2.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .comparison-title-wrap {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .comparison-title-wrap h3 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: var(--text-heading);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .comparison-title-wrap p {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .comparison-image-frame {
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .comparison-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .agitation-action-box {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .agitation-action-text {
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-heading);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .impact-metrics-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
